* LEDs — tune Vf via N/IS; these conduct ~1.9–2.1 V @ 20 mA (fine for "do they light")
.model LED_RED    D(IS=1e-20 N=1.9 RS=3 CJO=15p)
.model LED_YELLOW D(IS=1e-21 N=2.0 RS=3 CJO=15p)
.model LED_GREEN  D(IS=1e-21 N=2.0 RS=3 CJO=15p)

* 1N5822 40V/3A Schottky (low Vf ~0.5 V, EG=0.69)
.model D1N5822 D(IS=1.7e-4 RS=0.014 N=1.0 CJO=1.5n M=0.4 EG=0.69 XTI=2 BV=40 IBV=1e-4)

* P6KE6.8A TVS — crude clamp proxy (real TVS dynamics need more; OK for "does it limit")
.model P6KE6_8A D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.5 BV=6.8 IBV=1e-3)
